id: recall
name: Recall
prerequisite: 2+ Skill Ranks in Knowledge
requiresSkill: knowledge
requiresRanks: 2
sessionLimit: 1
timeCost: 1 Minute
# The information is the ARC's to give: said on the card - with the Specialty chosen for Knowledge.
effectNote: recalls a piece of information related to their chosen Specialty that may help with the current situation
effectSpecialty: knowledge
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A minute's thought: a piece of information from your Knowledge Specialty that may help right now.
text: >
  Recall: You wrack your memory for relevant information to present to your comrades.
  –Prerequisite: 2+ Skill Ranks in Knowledge
  –Session Limit: 1
  –Time Cost: 1 Minute
  –Effect: You recall a piece of information related to your chosen Specialty that may help with your
  current situation.

---

# Offered on the Adventure tab to whoever has 2+ Ranks in Knowledge. The card's button, once the minute
# is spent, says what it does and names the Specialty written on their Knowledge Skill; what they
# recall is the ARC's.
